<p>Hello <%= @user.name %>!</p>

<p>Someone requested a password reset for your <%= Branding.contextual_app_name %> account.</p>

<p>Click the link below to reset your password:</p>

<p><%= link_to "Reset password", @reset_url %></p>

<p>This link will expire in 1 hour.</p>

<p>If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your password will not be changed.</p>
